hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"55","Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min 'adhaabil-qabr, wa min 'adhaabi jahannam, wa min fitnatil-mahyaa wa mamaat, wa min sharri fitnatil-maseehid-dajjaal.. O Allah, I seek Your protection from the punishment of the grave, from the punishment of Hellfire, from the trials of life and death, and from the evil of the trial of the False Messiah (Dajjal)."
"56","Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min 'adhaabil-qabr, wa a'udhu bika min fitnatil-maseehid-dajjaal, wa a'udhu bika min fitnatil-mahyaa wal-mamaat. Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-ma'thami wal-maghram.. O Allah, I seek Your punishment of the grave, and I seek Your protection from the trial of the False Messiah (Dajjal), and I seek Your protection from the trials of life and death. O Allah, I seek Your protection from sin and debt."
